e heating and air  conditioning  our car tester adds that the amg version  of the s-class coupe  delivers 430 kilowatts of power and  zooms from zero to 103.9 seconds  but the speedometer only goes up to 250  kilometers an hour  and the fuel consumption is  optimistically estimated at 10 liters  per hundred kilometers  our car tester is probably going to need  a bit more than that today  like the s-class limousine the coupe is  available with a variety of driving  assistance systems that make the car  safer and more comfortable  one example is the distronic plus with a  steering assist function  and a stop and go pilot it allows  drivers to relax in traffic jams  hitting the gas braking and staying in  lane everything is  automatic the driver just has to get  used to technology  however the car seems to react quite  sluggishly  and you can catch yourself with your  foot hovering over the brake  just in case  our car tester says that those who fall  in love with the s-class coupe  but don't have 170 000 euros for the amg  version  might want to look at the s-500 version  it only costs 126  000 euros but also has a lot to offer  it's got a top performance motor great  design inside and out  and is sure to attract jealous looks  from other drivers  you
 

